us are already addicted to playing nethack again!!! In fact, over the past two
days I have gotten almost zero real work done. 

As far as myself is concerned, I have played enough NH 3.1 to partially 
complete a Norn's quest to the Shrine of Destiny, make it through the Medusa
level, cleared out the castle, only to have gotten my "ring of levitation" cursed by a Titan with no means to remove the curse. Just as I was setting off
to head back upstairs to get rid of the ring my cursed "unicorn horn" pretty
much ended those plans...

As I stated in a previous post, much THANKS to the dev team for a job well 
done!!! There has been nothing but positive comments from the people playing
here due to all the new and creative additions added to this version.

